[{"url":"/cn/zh/planners","family":"planners","id":"cn--zh--675f5b8866444072bb39fb64c0fde8af","title":"设计工具","name":"Design and planning","hero":null,"blocks":[{"type":"pub-hero","title":"设计与规划","texts":["一个人手持智能手机，利用增强现实技术查看空房间布置宜家产品的效果。","<p>设计你的梦想厨房、沙发、和储物系列吧！利用我们简单易用的设计工具，玩转各种颜色、风格、尺寸及组合。有了这些工具，你就可以轻松构思和创建理想的方案。</p>","IMAGE","设计与规划","side","Optional heading (h2)"],"images":["https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250619/7b2b6522c51e43d69d581ca8688e2a0f.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium"],"links":[{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250619/7b2b6522c51e43d69d581ca8688e2a0f.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""}],"settings":{"traceId":"cms-图片文本组合 Hero-设计与规划"}},{"type":"pub-text","title":null,"texts":["<h2>精心设计你的房间</h2>\n<p>使用房间设计工具，你可以创建详细的空间方案；设计你的厨房和浴室空间。</p>"],"images":[],"links":[],"settings":{"traceId":"cms-Text-"}},{"type":"pub-page-list","title":null,"texts":["cn--zh--kitchen-planner","/h5page/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fkitchen.planner.ikea.cn%2Fplanner%2F%23%2Fcn%2Fzh%2F","external","IMAGE","规划和设计你的厨房","ikea://default-module/H5?url=https%3A%2F%2Fkitchen.planner.ikea.cn%2Fplanner%2F%23%2Fcn%2Fzh%2F"],"images":["https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250319/71f7fe70d88f4dfbbf00b4d1f1185309.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250319/7e439f4487ba4342b2f2030b111000be.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250717/2886d0d4597f481fbedaf09c0324f43e.png?x-oss-process=style/medium","https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250717/818dd57dccbe4857855f2506b1e45e47.png?x-oss-process=style/medium","https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250717/3f7090943af44615a45cd4a5b57fe29b.png?x-oss-process=style/medium"],"links":[{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250319/71f7fe70d88f4dfbbf00b4d1f1185309.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""},{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250319/7e439f4487ba4342b2f2030b111000be.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""},{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250717/2886d0d4597f481fbedaf09c0324f43e.png?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""},{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250717/818dd57dccbe4857855f2506b1e45e47.png?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""},{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250717/3f7090943af44615a45cd4a5b57fe29b.png?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""},{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250717/9d56572a687f427e835a80e5094525bd.png?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""}],"settings":{"traceId":"cms-页面列表-"}},{"type":"pub-text","title":null,"texts":["<h2>打造适合你的空间和需求的产品设计</h2>\n<p>产品设计工具是一种简单易用的宜家设计工具，可以帮助你创建一个复杂的产品解决方案，满足你的需求。</p>\n<p>在这些设计工具中，你可以添加和删除模块化部件和内部配件，并保存你的设计以备之后使用。</p>\n<p>浏览所有设计工具：</p>"],"images":[],"links":[],"settings":{"traceId":"cms-Text-"}},{"type":"anchor-navigation","title":null,"texts":["BUTTON","YES","储物家具设计工具","803e1127a3ad4a5e8f54ce939fdce0aa","沙发设计工具","59e5ecb83b954a78a187372ecfc5c8d2"],"images":[],"links":[],"settings":{"traceId":"cms-页面导航-"}},{"type":"pub-text","title":null,"texts":["<h3>自定义理想的储物方案</h3>\n<p>为家中所有区域规划和设计不同的储物方案。使用PAX 帕克思 衣柜设计工具设计自己的衣柜，或者使用BEST&Aring; 贝达 设计工具打造独特的客厅储物方案。</p>"],"images":[],"links":[],"settings":{"traceId":"cms-Text-"}},{"type":"pub-page-list","title":null,"texts":["cn--zh--pax-planner","/planners/pax-planner/?layout=headless","external","IMAGE","PAX 帕克思 个性化的衣柜设计工具","ikea://planners/pax-planner"],"images":["https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250319/63d53f0ac32444808aae30e09b85418d.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250319/6b78e28958a74426ad42f680eab57c6b.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250319/3e8a4ab530cf44da884c2e28bd463375.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250319/edc41d7a0f50469f942553e4ab27a5c4.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250319/acaac06802104049a84bc6309a89a35e.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium"],"links":[{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250319/63d53f0ac32444808aae30e09b85418d.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""},{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250319/6b78e28958a74426ad42f680eab57c6b.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""},{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250319/3e8a4ab530cf44da884c2e28bd463375.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""},{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250319/edc41d7a0f50469f942553e4ab27a5c4.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""},{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250319/acaac06802104049a84bc6309a89a35e.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""},{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250319/0c5bfcee1c044764be2773b316d8e985.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""}],"settings":{"traceId":"cms-页面列表-"}},{"type":"pub-text","title":null,"texts":["<h3>组合你的理想沙发</h3>\n<p>借助模块化沙发设计工具，你可以用不同的模块或沙发套打造心仪的沙发组合。选择一款契合个性风格的沙发，然后为你的家居空间量身定制解决方案。</p>"],"images":[],"links":[],"settings":{"traceId":"cms-Text-"}},{"type":"pub-page-list","title":null,"texts":["cn--zh--vimle-planner","/planners/vimle-planner/?layout=headless","external","IMAGE","VIMLE 维姆勒 沙发设计工具","ikea://planners/vimle-planner"],"images":["https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250320/2f8f2d244b464ee88ded4693afd17e7e.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250320/baf7faec86fe47b1a80d5cb70a048e0c.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250320/95344227a5cd4203ab9f90b9f7cd774c.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250320/e2a3c674f1564d62b42846effaa96213.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20260402/29d827474f904a1fa35b0879e41dbe89.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium"],"links":[{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250320/2f8f2d244b464ee88ded4693afd17e7e.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""},{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250320/baf7faec86fe47b1a80d5cb70a048e0c.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""},{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250320/95344227a5cd4203ab9f90b9f7cd774c.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""},{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250320/e2a3c674f1564d62b42846effaa96213.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""},{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20260402/29d827474f904a1fa35b0879e41dbe89.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""}],"settings":{"traceId":"cms-页面列表-"}},{"type":"pub-text","title":null,"texts":["<h3><strong>玩转书桌</strong></h3>\n<p>借助书桌设计工具，你可以组合不同的桌面，桌腿和储物柜，从而简单轻松地打造适合你的书桌。</p>"],"images":[],"links":[],"settings":{"traceId":"cms-Text-"}},{"type":"pub-page-list","title":null,"texts":["/h5page/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ikea.cn%2Faddon-app%2Fspace%2Fplatform%2Flatest%2Fcn%2Fzh%2F%23%2Fconfigure%2Fbuild-your-own-desk","external","IMAGE","打造你的专属书桌","ikea://default-module/H5?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ikea.cn%2Faddon-app%2Fspace%2Fplatform%2Flatest%2Fcn%2Fzh%2F%23%2Fconfigure%2Fbuild-your-own-desk","{\"objectId_var\":\"https://www.ikea.cn/addon-app/space/platform/latest/cn/zh/#/configure/build-your-own-desk\",\"objectType_var\":\"default-module/H5\"}"],"images":["https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20251113/8f5f6a42fb4d4bf48455ee23c9c32a7e.png?x-oss-process=style/medium","https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20260707/86ebac2fffcd46c6addcbf685b40b28a.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium"],"links":[{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20251113/8f5f6a42fb4d4bf48455ee23c9c32a7e.png?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""},{"href":"https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20260707/86ebac2fffcd46c6addcbf685b40b28a.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium","text":""}],"settings":{"traceId":"cms-页面列表-"}},{"type":"pub-text","title":null,"texts":["<h3>为你构思和设计理想厨房</h3>\n<p>厨房设计工具是一款快速简单的工具，可让将你的ENHET 安纳特 厨房组合自定义为最适合你家庭的解决方案。</p>"],"images":[],"links":[],"settings":{"traceId":"cms-Text-"}},{"type":"pub-page-list","title":null,"texts":["/planners/enhet-planner/?layout=headless","external","IMAGE","ENHET 安纳特 厨房设计工具","ikea://planners/enhet-planner","{\"objectId_var\":\"enhet-planner\",\"objectType_var\":\"planners\"}"],"images":["https://file.app.ikea.cn/cms/u/20250320/8b1064b493a94cd09c4e21c86090394c.jpg?x-oss-process=style/medium"],"link